    "summary": "Either Fight Phase, or the Shooting Phase on your opponent’s turn. Once an enemy unit picks its targets, choose a WORLD EATERS unit of yours among those targets. Also choose a different BLOOD LEGIONS unit of yours within 6″ of the first. Through this phase, give models in your chosen WORLD EATERS unit a 5+ invulnerable save. Your army’s active Boon of Blood raises it to 4+.",
